## Expected Outcomes & Dissemination

The collaboration aims to yield two high-impact peer-reviewed manuscripts and an open-source software contribution:

1.  **Methodological Manuscript (Topic 1):** Target journal is the *International Journal of Forecasting (IJF)* or *Journal of Machine Learning Research (JMLR)*.

2.  **Open-Source Software:** Implementation of the newly developed point estimation techniques integrated directly into existing R/Python forecast reconciliation ecosystems (e.g., expanding the `FoReco` and/or `bayesreconpy`).

